  "title": "Ukraine and Russia: Aerial Attacks Escalate as US Envoys Revisit Moscow, with Two Bridges Hit",
  "summary": "A heavy Russian missile and drone bombardment has killed at least 15 people in and around Kyiv, with Ukrainian intelligence units describing a 'disgraceful' shootout. US envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner arrive in Moscow to try to revive peace talks, while Russia plans a 72-hour pause in strikes on Kyiv.",
  "facts": [
